Package: rigforge
Version: @VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash, jq, curl, nftables, git, build-essential, cmake, libuv1-dev, libssl-dev, libhwloc-dev, gettext-base, python3, msr-tools, linux-tools-common | linux-cpupower
Maintainer: RigForge maintainers <maintainers@rigforge.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/p2pool-starter-stack/rigforge
Description: Provision and run a tuned XMRig worker for RandomX mining
 RigForge provisions and runs an XMRig worker for a Pithead coordinator,
 any RandomX Stratum pool, or a solo daemon pool. Installing changes
 nothing on the host; run "sudo rigforge setup" to provision.
